  "body": "Effort: medium · fork synced at v0.17.0\n\n## What changed\n- 134 app suites in `crates/app/tests` named modules that M4.1 moved out of `app` as `app::<module>`; quick matches another crate's module as `<crate>::<module>`, so those suites were never selected. Headers (comments only) now name the owning crate (`post::post`, `sim::verify`, `motion::machining2d`, `tools::tools`, ...). Wrapper modules (`machine`, `stock_sim`, `fixture`) keep `app::X` and gain the crate name beside it.\n- `heidenhain_cycles` gets a Gate map.\n- New `xtask/src/gate_maps_tests.rs` reads the REAL headers and pins the selection.\n- `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` 16 -> 17 (xtask is a process file). A fork needs nothing beyond the normal process sync.\n- Decision: `docs/decisions/922-gate-maps.md`.\n\n## Selection, app suites picked by one changed file (before -> after)\n- `crates/post/src/post/mod.rs`: 3 -> 33\n- `crates/post/src/post/engine.rs` (submodule narrowing): 1 -> 8\n- `crates/sim/src/verify/mod.rs`: 10 -> 42\n- `crates/motion/src/machining2d/mod.rs`: 3 -> 32\n\n## Tested\n- `cargo test -p xtask`: 37 passed (new: `post_change_selects_the_post_dialect_suites`, `post_submodule_change_narrows_but_still_selects`, `sim_verify_change_selects_the_verify_suites`, `motion_machining2d_change_selects_the_machining2d_suites`, `no_gate_map_names_a_moved_module_as_app`).\n- `cargo clippy -p xtask --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n- Not run: the 134 app suites (header comments only, no code).\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #922\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL\n",
